.DS_Store
docs/scratch/
__pycache__/

# Claude Code workspace plumbing — never publish.
# `.claude/*` rather than `.claude/`: git will not descend into an ignored DIRECTORY, so a
# negation beneath a `.claude/` pattern can never re-include anything. settings.json is tracked
# on purpose — it carries this repo's attribution policy, which must hold on any machine.
.claude/*
!.claude/settings.json
.superpowers/
# CLAUDE.md is intentionally TRACKED (repo operating notes) — keep it mechanics-only, no secrets/private paths.
